  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.7.0\n- Requires DevInstance.WebServiceToolkit.Common 10.4.0 (adds HighlightRange and IModelListHighlights, used by the Components package's HDataGrid).\n- No other changes; released together with DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components 10.7.0.\n\n10.6.0\n- BREAKING: the UI components (ErrorMessageBanner, PageProgress, LoadingProgress, DataPager, ModelDataPager, SortableHeader, BlazorToolkitPageLayout) moved to the new DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components package. Add that package if you use any of them; the namespace (DevInstance.BlazorToolkit.Components) is unchanged, so no code changes are needed.\n- ServiceExecutionHostComponent stays in this package.\n- Watch out: if the Components package is missing, Razor does not fail the build. It only emits warning RZ10012 and the components silently render nothing. Add <WarningsAsErrors>$(WarningsAsErrors);RZ10012</WarningsAsErrors> to your project while upgrading.\nSee https://github.com/devInstance/BlazorToolkit/blob/master/docs/USAGE.md#ui-components",
